"我叫 Daniel。我 38 岁，在实验室担任生物学家。我对植物和细胞特别感兴趣。":"My name is Daniel. I am 38 years old and work as a biologist in a laboratory. I am especially interested in plants and cells.",
"我的工作日 8 点开始。到实验室时，我先穿上实验服，然后洗手并准备工作台。":"My working day begins at 8:00. When I come into the lab, I first put on my lab coat, then wash my hands and prepare my workbench.",
"早上我检查实验。我研究植物细胞，经常用显微镜工作。在显微镜下我能看到肉眼看不见的微小东西。":"In the morning I check my experiments. I examine plant cells and often work with a microscope. Under the microscope I can see tiny things that the naked eye cannot.",
"我也做很多笔记。每个实验我都记下我做了什么、观察到了什么。这对我的工作非常重要。":"I also take a lot of notes. For every experiment I write down what I do and what I observe. That is very important for my work.",
"10 点半左右我短暂休息。我喝杯咖啡，和同事们聊天。我们聊工作，有时也聊周末或家人。":"Around 10:30 I take a short break. I drink a coffee and chat with my colleagues. We talk about work, and sometimes about the weekend or our families.",
"之后我回到实验室。有时我准备新实验。我使用各种仪器并检测样品。样品可以是比如一小块植物。":"Afterwards I go back to the lab. Sometimes I prepare new experiments. I use various instruments and examine samples. A sample can be, for example, a small piece of a plant.",
