"下午我常在电脑前工作。我查看实验结果、撰写报告。有时我们也开会，讨论新项目和研究。":"In the afternoon I often work at the computer. I look at the results of my experiments and write reports. Sometimes we also have a meeting and discuss new projects and our research.",
"我的工作日常在 17 点结束。回家前，我整理工作台并再次检查实验。":"My working day normally ends at 17:00. Before I go home, I tidy my workbench and check my experiments once more.",
"我的工作有时很难，但从不无聊。我喜欢生物学，因为总有新东西可以发现。":"My work is sometimes difficult, but never boring. I like biology because there is always something new to discover.",
"Mia 在一家小型研究实验室担任生物学家。她在那里检测食品和微生物。昨天，她度过了特别有趣的一个工作日。":"Mia works as a biologist in a small research laboratory. There she examines food and microorganisms. Yesterday she had a particularly interesting working day.",
"早上 7:15，Mia 就来到了实验室。她首先打开电脑、读了电子邮件。之后她穿上实验服并洗了手。":"At 7:15 in the morning Mia came into the lab. She first switched on her computer and read her emails. Afterwards she put on her lab coat and washed her hands.",
"她的桌上放着几份来自乳品厂的样品。Mia 需要检测样品中是否存在特定细菌。首先，她检查了所有容器，并记录了样品编号。":"Several samples from a dairy were on her table. Mia had to test whether specific bacteria were present in the samples. First she checked all the containers and noted the sample numbers.",
"随后，Mia 准备了少量样品。她使用了不同的仪器，工作非常细致。同事 Elena 随后来到实验室，协助了 Mia 的工作。":"Mia then prepared small quantities of the samples. She used various instruments and worked very carefully. A colleague named Elena came into the lab later and helped Mia with the work.",
"10 点左右，两人短暂休息。Mia 喝了杯咖啡，Elena 吃了盒酸奶。期间她们聊到了假期和周末计划。":"Around 10:00 the two took a short break. Mia drank a coffee and Elena ate a yoghurt. They talked about their holidays and their plans for the weekend.",
"休息过后，Mia 和 Elena 继续检测样品。在一份样品中，她们发现了一个意料之外的结果。因此她们把检测重新做了一遍。":"After the break Mia and Elena carried on examining the samples. In one sample they found an unexpected result. So they repeated the test.",
"12:30 她们去了食堂。午饭后 Mia 回到实验室，在电脑上录入了新的结果。":"At 12:30 they went to the canteen. After lunch Mia went back to the lab and entered the new results on the computer.",
"下午，Mia 和团队主管通了电话，讲述了这一异常结果。主管决定团队第二天做进一步测试。":"In the afternoon Mia phoned her team leader and told her about the unusual result. The team leader decided that the team should run further tests the next day.",
"最后，Mia 整理了工作台、清洗了仪器，并将样品安全归位。16:30 她骑自行车回家了。":"Finally Mia tidied her workbench, cleaned the instruments and put the samples safely away. At 16:30 she cycled home.",
